                "title": "Cortina Lever with Regular Round Rose",
                "description": "The Cortina Lever with Regular Round Rose is a classic--a great choice for traditional homes. This drop-tail leverset will look fabulous in any of the beautiful finishes in which it is available. The Cortina Lever with Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and is available in either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Cortina Lever with Regular Round Roses, Drop Tail Lever with Round Rosettes, Emtek 8050C, Emtek 8100C, Emtek 8200C, EMT-8050C, Cortina door lever set, Classic Drop Tail Levers, Drop Tail Lever with round Rosettes, Cortina Lever with Round Roses, Cortina Drop Tail Lever with Regular Roses, Traditional Cortina Leversets,"
